</table></div><p class="mut" style="margin:6px 0 0"><b>10 笔里 4 笔买在源1 净卖的票上</b>（002474 / 688218 / 002343 / 002535，合计 0.5337 亿＝S/A 买额的 27.2%）——A 档不等于是聪明的钱，席位档位只给「历史胜率」，不给「今日方向」。这也是本路必须叠双源筛的原因。</p></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-bb95707cb336c2be"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><details class="chain" open><summary><b>10-26</b> <span class="chip cold">最新</span> 上榜73 · 机构在场36只 · S/A出手21笔</summary><div class="inner"><div class="strip"><div class="kv"><div class="l">上榜(买侧明细)</div><div class="v">73</div></div><div class="kv"><div class="l">机构在场</div><div class="v">36</div></div><div class="kv"><div class="l">S/A出手</div><div class="v">21笔</div></div></div><p style="font-weight:700;margin:8px 0 4px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding-left:8px">当日席位路Top5荐票(S/A席位动向v3·第2路)</p><div class="card"><p><a href="#component-SEATCARD">回看同一份数据表</a></p></div><div class="hint">候选=当日S/A席位净买≥1000万(65个S/A,候选12只);席位胜率=滚动执行口径历史值(窗口20260401~20261023),非个股预言;结构分仅辅助。结算列次日由结算脚本原位回填,同一张表不换结构。</div><p style="font-weight:700;margin:14px 0 4px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding-left:8px">今日S/A席位动向全表(出手21笔)</p><div class="card"><p><a href="#table-a010b121bc3bdc84">回看同一份数据表</a></p></div></div></details></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-1f7522a22bc7f4c0"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-1f7522a22bc7f4c0">历史来源 · 10-23 存档 上榜81 · 机构在场39只 · S/A出手24笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-8033183fcb4e2dfe"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><a href="history_sources/lhb.html#claim-lhb-8033183fcb4e2dfe">历史来源 · 10-22 存档 上榜66 · 机构在场30只 · S/A出手12笔</a></p></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-d6e09e7057001f72"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="cla